<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Automation on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/automation/</link><description>Recent content in Automation on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/automation/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Aloud</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/aloud/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/aloud/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Aloud is built for the gap between what a developer means and what ends up in a written bug report or feature request. It records voice, screen, and a live transcript while someone talks through their app the way they naturally would, pointing at elements and changing their mind mid-sentence, then converts that into a clean set of instructions, flags anything that could be read two ways, and attaches the relevant screenshots.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ChatGPT Atlas</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-atlas/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-atlas/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Viktor</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Viktor is an AI agent from Zeta Labs that lives inside Slack and Microsoft Teams instead of a standalone interface. It connects to a company&amp;rsquo;s existing tools, learns the patterns of how a team works over time, and steps in with suggestions or completed work such as campaign drafts, internal apps, and reports, without waiting for someone to open a separate app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Labs, the team behind the earlier AI email assistant Jace, launched Viktor on Slack first and expanded it to Microsoft Teams in mid-2026. The company says tens of thousands of teams have adopted it, and it has raised a $75 million Series A led by Accel. Viktor targets teams that want an AI agent that acts inside the channels where work already happens rather than one more tool to switch into.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Zetik</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/zetik/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/zetik/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Zetik positions itself as a personal intelligence staffer: it monitors podcasts, academic papers, code activity, social posts, and news for the subjects a user tells it to track, then compresses everything into a short brief instead of leaving the user to hunt through separate feeds. The pitch is similar to how an executive relies on staff to stay current, applied to an individual&amp;rsquo;s own interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product launched on Product Hunt in August 2026 and climbed to the top of the daily leaderboard within its first two weeks. Its makers have said Claude Code was central to building it, taking the project from prototype to a shipped product quickly with a small team.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Comet</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Genspark</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenAI Presence</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Baidu Qianfan</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Cohere North</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Palantir AIP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Tencent Cloud ADP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Letta</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/letta/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/letta/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Lindy</title><link